{"title":"Alabama MathCounts","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Alabama <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> team has achieved numerous top 10 finishes at the National MathCounts competition and won the national championship in 1991.  Now retired <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a> teacher <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cindy_Wright\" title=\"Cindy Wright\">Cindy Wright</a> coached the 1991 national champion Alabama team as well as many other state teams.\n</p><p>MathCounts problems and competition results are sometimes discussed in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=172\">Alabama Forum</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#National_awards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National awards</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#State_Team_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">State Team Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#State_Team_Members\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">State Team Members</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#2006\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2006</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#2007\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2007</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#2008\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2008</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#2009\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2009</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#2021\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2021</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#2022\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2022</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#2023\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2023</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#MathCounts_resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">MathCounts resources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_awards\">National awards</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: National awards\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Alabama MathCounts team has placed in the top 10 at the national competition numerous times and won the national championship at the 1991 competition.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"State_Team_Champions\">State Team Champions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: State Team Champions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>1990 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a></li>\n<li>1991 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a></li>\n<li>2006 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Randolph_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Randolph School (page does not exist)\">Randolph School</a></li>\n<li>2007 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a></li>\n<li>2008 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a></li>\n<li>2009 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"State_Team_Members\">State Team Members</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: State Team Members\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2006\">2006</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: 2006\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>1. Steven Hwang - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Randolph_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Randolph School (page does not exist)\">Randolph School</a></li>\n<li>2. Sanket Shah - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Randolph_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Randolph School (page does not exist)\">Randolph School</a></li>\n<li>3. Megan Covington - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Challenger_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Challenger Middle School (page does not exist)\">Challenger Middle School</a></li>\n<li>4. Lucy Xie - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a></li>\n<li>5. Eugene Wu - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a> (Alternate)</li></ul>\n<p>Eugene Wu substituted for Megan Covington for National MATHCOUNTS.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2007\">2007</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: 2007\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Nationals Coach - Susan Clopton - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a> Coach</li>\n<li>1. Xinke Guo-Xue - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a></li>\n<li>2. Owen Scott - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Pizitz Middle School (page does not exist)\">Louis Pizitz Middle School</a></li>\n<li>3. Eugene Wu - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a></li>\n<li>4. Ryan McRae - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Phillips_Prepatory&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Phillips Prepatory (page does not exist)\">Phillips Prepatory</a></li>\n<li>5. Wesley Chow - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a> (Alternate)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2008\">2008</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: 2008\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Nationals Coach - Nancy Chilton [(Louis Pizitz Middle School)] Coach</li>\n<li>1. Tony Zeng [(Louis Pizitz Middle School)]</li>\n<li>2. Sid Nanda <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Challenger_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Challenger Middle School (page does not exist)\">Challenger Middle School</a></li>\n<li>3. Nick Sparkman <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Challenger_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Challenger Middle School (page does not exist)\">Challenger Middle School</a></li>\n<li>4. Wesley Chow <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simmons_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Simmons Middle School (page does not exist)\">Simmons Middle School</a></li>\n<li>5. Jerry Hsu <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louis_Pizitz_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;red